message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper (manuscript under review) and this repository."
title: "El Niño and malaria across Indian states, 2002–2025: data and code"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hssling/elnino-malaria-india"
url: "https://github.com/hssling/elnino-malaria-india"
type: software
